{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"4901017320010","name":"霧子","text":"トン……トン……","trans":"咚……咚……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-7","name":"プロデューサー","text":"トン、トン","trans":"咚，咚","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017320020","name":"霧子","text":"サク……サク……","trans":"嚓……嚓……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-15","name":"プロデューサー","text":"サク、サク","trans":"嚓，嚓","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017320030","name":"霧子","text":"８つに切ったら……\r\n鍋に入れます……","trans":"切成8块……\n放进锅里……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-20","name":"プロデューサー","text":"よし、任せてくれ","trans":"好，交给我吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017320040","name":"霧子","text":"はい……","trans":"好的……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017320050","name":"霧子","text":"そしたら……\r\nレモンの汁と……砂糖を……","trans":"然后……\n把柠檬汁……和砂糖……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-32","name":"プロデューサー","text":"うん\r\n──全部入れていいか？","trans":"嗯\n──全都放进去可以吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017320070","name":"霧子","text":"あとは……\r\nゆっくり……透明になるまで……","trans":"接下来就……\n慢慢地……直到变得透明……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017320080","name":"霧子","text":"コト……コト……","trans":"咕嘟……咕嘟……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-42","name":"プロデューサー","text":"了解だ\r\n……はは、霧子のおばあちゃんのレシピかぁ","trans":"了解\n……哈哈，是雾子奶奶的食谱啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-46","name":"プロデューサー","text":"透明になったら、どうなるんだ？","trans":"变透明之后，会变成什么样？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017320100","name":"霧子","text":"クリスマスのにおいが……\r\n広がって……","trans":"圣诞节的味道……\n飘散开来……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017320110","name":"霧子","text":"プロデューサーさんの……\r\nプレゼントになります……","trans":"会成为……\n制作人的礼物……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}